OL,3,GNEWSABGT group expands day provision
OL,4,Aservices
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new service for adults with
OL,7,Fadditional needs is boosting their
OL,8,Fconfidence, users have said.
OL,10,FInclusive performing arts group, Born
OL,11,Fto Perform, who reached the semi-finals
OL,12,Fof Britain's Got Talent in April 2022,
OL,13,Fruns the sessions at Buckton Fields
OL,14,FCommunity Centre in Northampton, which
OL,15,Foffers support through performing arts,
OL,16,Fcrafts, gardening and practical skills.
OL,18,FThe group came to wider attention after
OL,19,Fappearing on ITV's show, where judge
OL,20,FDavid Walliams used his golden buzzer
OL,21,Ffor its performance.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
