OL,3,GNEWSABGT group expands day provision
OL,4,Aservices
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Wakelin, whose son Kayln attends
OL,7,Fthe group, said: "He's a lot more
OL,8,Fconfident, he's made more friends, is
OL,9,Fmore outgoing, and has met loads more
OL,10,Fnew people."
